<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dillon starts Stericycle.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dillon starts Stericycle.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dillon, Read said analysts Raul Esquivel and Matthew Dodds initiated coverage of medical waste management company Stericycle Inc with a buy rating and a one-year $15-$17 price target.</p>
<p>-- The stock was unchanged at 9-1/4.</p>
</text>
